OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader forgives woman who
OL,4,Amade bomb threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader says she has forgiven
OL,7,Fa woman who threatened to kill her by
OL,8,Fbombing the doctor's surgery where she
OL,9,Fworks as a GP.
OL,11,FShabina Qayyum, leader of Peterborough
OL,12,FCity Council, was the subject of a
OL,13,Fdeath threat made by Khadija Nadeem,
OL,14,F40, on 13 July.
OL,16,FNadeem, of Reeves Way, Peterborough,
OL,17,Fwas handed a suspended prison sentence
OL,18,Fearlier this month after threatening to
OL,19,F"burn and bomb" Qayyum's workplace.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
